abstract: 'Six complete Lean formalizations for the two-supplier random-capacity model: submodularity,
  maximizing-order existence, the exact CDF derivative, optimized-profit reliability monotonicity, corrected
  deterministic-demand optimizer regions, and hedge-size/region comparisons. Distinct hypotheses and pre-existing
  platform repairs are explicit. Includes pinned full-type and axiom audits, reproducible evidence and
  rejecting controls. Source and platform authors are credited; substantial Codex assistance is disclosed.
  No mathematical novelty or independent human review claimed.'
